4,0$a) No distinctive odour; flesh not reddening when broken . $gr. dulcamara 
4,0$b) Distinctive odour (pleasant or not); flesh usually reddening more or less intensely when broken$gr. bongardii
5,0$a) Cap cuticle with radially arranged fibrils, splitting with âge; terricolous$gr. fastigiata
